IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `je54-nouns`
IMPORT `je54-schedule-definitions`

-- je54-tests-schedule-definitions: Article 4 and the Schedule.  The expected forms ("shall mean"/"means" against "includes"/"shall include"/"shall be construed as including") were read off the verbs of the Schedule's
-- text, one word at a time, before this module was run.  The expected strings are the Schedule's words.

`text V1` MEANS `V1, 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021`
`text V2a` MEANS `V2a, 28 September 2021 to 30 January 2022`
`text V2b` MEANS `V2b, 31 January 2022 to 31 August 2022`
`text V2c` MEANS `V2c, 1 September 2022 to 10 January 2024`
`text V2d` MEANS `V2d, 11 January 2024 to 23 November 2025`
`text V2e` MEANS `V2e, 24 November 2025 to 18 June 2026`
`text V2f` MEANS `V2f, 19 June 2026 to current`
`text inferred` MEANS `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018`
`text none` MEANS `no text before 28 March 2003`

GIVEN w IS A STRING
      v IS A `Text of the Law`
GIVETH A `Form of a definition`
`the form of` w `in` v MEANS (`the Schedule's definition of` w `in the text` v)'s definition's form

GIVEN w IS A STRING
      v IS A `Text of the Law`
GIVETH A STRING
`the Schedule's words for` w `in` v MEANS (`the Schedule's definition of` w `in the text` v)'s definition's `the Schedule's words`

